stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> IDLE : rst_n = 0
  IDLE --> IDLE : rx_in = 1
  IDLE --> START : rx_in = 0
  START --> START : !medio_bit
  START --> IDLE : medio_bit & rx_in = 1 (glitch)
  START --> DATA : medio_bit & rx_in = 0
  DATA --> DATA : !fin_bit | !ultimo_bit
  DATA --> STOP : fin_bit & ultimo_bit
  STOP --> STOP : !fin_bit
  STOP --> IDLE : fin_bit / byte_listo (rx_in=1) o error_trama (rx_in=0)
